 "notes": "Inline policies accepted as aws_iam_role_policy or inline_policy blocks (named, with actions/resources found in planned or declared policy text). For inline_policy blocks the name and the policy text are matched on the same block, so the two policies' contents cannot be swapped. Actions and Resource '*' are not bound to one statement."
